{"slug":"Universal-Script-Anonymous-Name-72537","_id":"69320f531557f5b04aa23746","title":"Anonymous Name","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"This script allows you to spoof your Roblox name while keeping your identity hidden during recordings, screenshots, and more. It ensures your real username never leaks.\n\n❓┃How it works:\n- Enter a custom Username and Display Name in the textboxes, or leave them blank to generate random ones automatically.\n- Replaces all mentions of your Username and Display Name in CoreGui.\n- Replaces all mentions of your Username and Display Name in PlayerGui.\n- Updates your Name Tag to match the spoofed identity.\n\n✅┃Result:\n- Your Chat Message Name, Leaderboard Name, Roblox Menu Name, and other identifiers appear anonymous.\n\nℹ️┃Note:\nAll changes are strictly client-side, meaning the spoofed name is only visible to you.\n\n❌┃FAQ:\n- \"Can other players see my spoofed name?\" → No. It's client-side only.\n- \"Why does my alt see my real name?\" → Because the spoof only changes your own client, never other players.\n- \"Can I use this to troll people?\" → No. The spoof only appears on your own screen.\n\n- Made by BurgerMan\nOther Script: https://scriptblox.com/script/Universal-Script-Burger-Hub-24339\n\nTags:\nanonymous name changer - name spoof - name change - universal - script - keyless - free","tags":["anonymous","name spoofer","name changer","free","keyless"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BurgerMann/Burger-Hub-Scripts/refs/heads/main/Anonymous%20Name\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67488d6db319ed7a656dfca8","username":"BurgerMan","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/16366aa7ea579776f42d4270b5da9893828c0c585cf929acf6a33faa92ecf6b5.webp","ori